    },
    {
      "id": "claim_91d9c343e77f439c81ecaad96ae28ef0",
      "statement": "logoutAction is idempotent and reverses login side effects: it no-ops when no session exists, rate-limits by player id under scope auth:logout (10/60s), optionally resigns the active match (swallowing resignMatch failures except RateLimitExceededError and ZodError), expires presence, forgets the presence cache entry, and deletes the session cookie.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/actions/auth/logout.ts#L31-L77",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:14637af50dd71373730dd697ee42015d619cdd82d8ee510e4146545a7f0be20d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b4b605c8f5504cd48c1e8b4f0ba5e8d7",
      "statement": "The session cookie TTL (4 hours) is independent of and longer than the lobby_presence TTL (PLAYTEST_PRESENCE_TTL_SECONDS, default 300s), so a still-authenticated player can drop out of the lobby snapshot when presence lapses.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/matchmaking/profile.ts#L179-L225",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:52d99281455d447bf03004ae4080aacf907a84f91b4de23333e04a3530dd3722:"
